    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Hinton and Salakhutdinov, \"Reducing the dimensionality of data with neural networks\" (Science, 2006): a deep autoencoder squeezes each image through a few numbers and rebuilds it, and its codes keep more of the data than PCA with the same number of components. Recipe: 10,000 MNIST digits (they ship with the repo), 784-256-2-256-784 with a Sigmoid output, MSE, Adam at lr 0.002, 40 epochs, then 1000 test digits through both methods. With seed 0 on a CPU the autoencoder rebuilds them at MSE 0.0438 against PCA's 0.0547, and a 5-nearest-neighbour vote in the 2-D code space names the digit right 0.59 of the time against 0.45 for PCA.\n\nHinton 與 Salakhutdinov，〈Reducing the dimensionality of data with neural networks〉（Science，2006）：深層自編碼器把每張圖壓成幾個數字再重建回來，它的編碼保留的資訊比同樣維度的 PCA 更多。配方：10,000 張 MNIST 數字（隨 repo 附帶），784-256-2-256-784，輸出接 Sigmoid，MSE，Adam、lr 0.002，40 個 epoch，再把 1000 張測試數字分別送進兩種方法。seed 0、用 CPU 跑，自編碼器的重建 MSE 是 0.0438，PCA 是 0.0547；在 2 維編碼空間用最近 5 個鄰居投票判斷數字，自編碼器答對的比例是 0.59，PCA 是 0.45。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-data",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 760
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "DatasetBatch takes the first 10,000 training and 1000 test images in one tensor each. The script after it undoes Dataset's default [-1, 1] scaling and flattens every image to 784 values. TensorDataset pairs the images with themselves: the target of an autoencoder is its input.\n\nDatasetBatch 一次取出前 10,000 張訓練圖和 1000 張測試圖，各成一個張量。後面的腳本把 Dataset 預設的 [-1, 1] 縮放還原，並把每張圖攤平成 784 個值。TensorDataset 讓圖片和自己配對：自編碼器的目標就是它的輸入。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "mnist-test",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 340
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 980,
        "y": -760
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Layer editor: Linear 784 -> 256, ReLU, Linear 256 -> 2 (the code), Linear 2 -> 256, ReLU, Linear 256 -> 784, Sigmoid. The paper used 784-1000-500-250-2 with layer-wise RBM pretraining; this one is shallower and trains end to end with Adam.\n\n圖層編輯器：Linear 784 -> 256、ReLU、Linear 256 -> 2（編碼）、Linear 2 -> 256、ReLU、Linear 256 -> 784、Sigmoid。論文用的是 784-1000-500-250-2，並逐層以 RBM 預訓練；這裡淺一些，用 Adam 從頭端到端訓練。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-codes",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 2600,
        "y": 420
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The encoder half is layers l0 to l2 of the trained model. Each test digit becomes 2 numbers, plotted coloured by its label. The 5-NN score counts how often a digit's 5 nearest codes mostly carry its own label.\n\n編碼器是訓練好的模型中第 l0 到 l2 層。每張測試數字變成 2 個數字，依標籤上色畫出來。5-NN 分數計算一張數字最近的 5 個編碼多數和它同標籤的比例。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
